ods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"xt8CHsSR-WuiCNO8z2jnFw","review_id":"Piy0O4Mlf5-b3CRjghOqjQ","date":"2011-07-22T02:21:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9290986061096191,"text_excerpt":"LOVE that chicken from Popeyes! This isn't the best location but it does the job for me."},{"business_id":"xt8CHsSR-WuiCNO8z2jnFw","review_id":"aMack9Nig-qEIqco7h6ABg","date":"2018-06-14T02:07:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9188421964645386,"text_excerpt":"There's always something for 5 bucks, so can the hungry (who aren't vegan/vegetarian) ever go wrong? The new waive is the rippin' chicken, which I think is only sold spicy ! I ordered the 'slaw which is a perfect contrast to the spicy chicken! The line moved quickly, but maybe that's because it was after 9pm when I arrived. I'm assuming they're slower around that time on a regular basis. No complaints!"},{"business_id":"xt8CHsSR-WuiCNO8z2jnFw","review_id":"mvuyHGSAgAEq2_p5FdxhbA","date":"2019-11-08T22:30:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8952540159225464,"text_excerpt":"Surprisingly, the wait wasn't long. I think I waited about 10mins. As for the sandwich, this is my second time eating it. The thickness is still there but it's smaller than last time. It fits the bun. If your 'body is built on Popeyes' growing up, you will love the sandwich. It has the same spice. Overall, it's a delicious sandwich, BUT not enough for you to stab someone or to ruin your car to skip the line. People need to be patient and just enjoy their sandwich. #yumyumyum."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"xt8CHsSR-WuiCNO8z2jnFw","photo_id":"ejoBI13JHfAc4OHpx00R9w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ejoBI13JHfAc4OHpx00R9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9215967655181885},{"business_id":"xt8CHsSR-WuiCNO8z2jnFw","photo_id":"c1HB0F8AJab1d8ps-FK0Kw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/c1HB0F8AJab1d8ps-FK0Kw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8262325525283813},{"business_id":"xt8CHsSR-WuiCNO8z2jnFw","photo_id":"znJHTVMME-nosuqpyLPB_A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/znJHTVMME-nosuqpyLPB_A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8187813758850098},{"business_id":"xt8CHsSR-WuiCNO8z2jnFw","photo_id":"c9F089SWT5zkoU6hYJaQ-g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/c9F089SWT5zkoU6hYJaQ-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7989981770515442},{"business_id":"xt8CHsSR-WuiCNO8z2jnFw","photo_id":"K0E-s775OKbC9rSPk9HvyQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/K0E-s775OKbC9rSPk9HvyQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7449468374252319}]},"notebook_case":null}
